WEBVTT - Class 1 English Mridang Chapter 9: Anandi's Rainbow

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:45.000
<v Teacher Tara>The morning rain clears away, and the bright sun peeks out. Look high into the blue sky—a giant, glowing rainbow has appeared!

00:00:45.000 --> 00:01:30.000
<v Teacher Tara>Count the seven magic colours: Violet, Indigo, Blue, Green, Yellow, Orange, and Red! Remember the word: VIBGYOR!

00:01:30.000 --> 00:02:15.000
<v Teacher Tara>Anandi dips her paintbrush in rainbow colours! She paints violet roses, emerald green leaves, a bright yellow sunflower, and an orange marigold!

00:02:15.000 --> 00:03:00.000
<v Teacher Tara>Look at the garden now! Every flower is smiling with the colours of the sky. The world is full of colour and wonder!

